{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17672","headline":"郡斋感物寄长安亲友 · 羊士谔","name":"郡斋感物寄长安亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴天春意并无穷，过腊江楼日日风。\n琼树花香故人别，兰巵酒色去年同。\n闲吟铃阁巴歌里，回首神臯瑞气中。\n自愧朝衣犹在箧，归来应是白头翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}